        "cooked": "<p>I made some tuckpacks (sleeve-like folders) to keep my oversized panels organized in the box, and have posted the files to <a href=\"http://www.spiffworld.com/gsf/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">my GSF site</a> if anyone else is interested. &nbsp;There's one each for Strike Force Ships, Opposition Ships, and Sector panels.</p><p>![](upload://as35SZFqgxM3GQDVyUveTdKFzRR.jpeg)</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/4/494174d4255d1b2c44af1e10d7463d0e22c4ff4f.jpeg\" alt=\"IMG_0457.jpg\" data-base62-sha1=\"as35SZFqgxM3GQDVyUveTdKFzRR\" width=\"500\" height=\"375\"></p>",
