        "created_at": "2014-06-08T05:07:07.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Thanks. &nbsp;While they may look good, I'm not so happy about how much printer ink they use, ink which gets on your fingers as you handle the tuckpacks. &nbsp;I'm thinking of putting up a v2.0 which uses the same template but is much more basic.</p><p>I have plans to make tuckpacks for each of the Strike Force Ship's starting card sets too, but I can't get Christopher to send me the art...</p>",
