        "raw": "<p>Thanks. &nbsp;While they may look good, I&#39;m not so happy about how much printer ink they use, ink which gets on your fingers as you handle the tuckpacks. &nbsp;I&#39;m thinking of putting up a v2.0 which uses the same template but is much more basic.</p><p>I have plans to make tuckpacks for each of the Strike Force Ship&#39;s starting card sets too, but I can&#39;t get Christopher to send me the art...</p>",
